    "markdown": "\n---\ntitle: Projects\ndescription: A collection of projects that may or may not be related to my research.\npreview: images/circular_crop_pdp.drawio.png\nexecute: \n  echo: false\n  message: false\n  warning: false\nformat:\n  html: \n    css: css/strapless.css\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<div class=\"row p-0 row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3\" style=\"margin-left: -.2rem; margin-right: -.2rem; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; \">\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/wearable-hydration/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/wearable-hydration-gemini.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/wearable-hydration/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Wearable hydration tracking</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Smartwatch prototype for real-time hydration monitoring.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12150694/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/hajj-wearable.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12150694/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Hajj pilgrims monitoring from wearable data</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">real-time detection of health-relevant contexts, including physical tiredness, emotional mood, and activity type using data collected via wearable sensors.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/wearable-covid-19/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/covid.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/wearable-covid-19/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Early Detection of COVID-19 Using Wearable Device Data</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">using physiological data from consumer wearable devices to predict COVID-19 infection before symptom onset</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/wireless-corne/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/wireless_corne.jpeg\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/wireless-corne/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">RNA-seq splicing analysis pipeline</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Build log and gallery of how I built my wireless Corne keyboard.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/motif-xplorer\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/motif-xplorer.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/motif-xplorer\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">MotifXplorer</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Genomic Peak Analysis Web Tool, discover hidden patterns in ChIP-seq data effortlessly</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/NazimBL/SpectralDiffusionLab\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/spectral-diffusion.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/NazimBL/SpectralDiffusionLab\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Spectral Diffusion Lab</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Usindiffusion models to generate synthetic spectroscopy data for safer and richer data in medical AI.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://jhelvy.github.io/magaScreener/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/magaScreener.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://jhelvy.github.io/magaScreener/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">NSF water contamination</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Tool for analyzing documents for specific MAGA-targeted keywords, intended to be used to help identify words that might get screened by the federal government.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://jhelvy.github.io/renderthis/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/renderthis.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://jhelvy.github.io/renderthis/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Weka activity detection</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">R package for rendering slides and other media into different formats, including html, pdf, png, gif, pptx, and mp4.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/muse-bci/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/bci_gemini.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/muse-bci/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">BCI Project</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Prototype for a low-cost EEG-based brain-computer interface system controlling a robotic arm.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/vr-ms/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/vr-ms.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"projects/vr-ms/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Immersive VR Rehab for Multiple Sclerosis</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Concept and research plan for bimanual VR rehabilitation in MS</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:6821393409236844544/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/deadline_Iot_BB.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:6821393409236844544/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Deadline IoT BlackBoard</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">An ESP32-based IoT development board featuring 4 opto-isolated relays, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth connectivity, and built-in USB-UART for easy programming. Designed and sold for academic and industrial use.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://p4a.jhelvy.com\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/projects/p4a.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://p4a.jhelvy.com\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Programming for Analytics in R</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Open source text book on the fundamentals of programming and working with data in R.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/formr4conjoint/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/formr4conjoint.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/formr4conjoint/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">formr4conjoint</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Template for how to create a choice-based conjoint survey using the formr survey platform.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card bg-transparent m-0 border-0 collapse.show bs4cards-blahblahblah \" style=\"padding: .2rem ; border-width: 0; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/iris-rev2/\" style=\"color: inherit;\">\n<img src=\"images/iris_rev2.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px 1px 0 1px; border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0 ;\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body justify-content-end m-0 p-0\" style=\"visibility: visible; background-color: #FFFFFFFF; border-style:solid; border-color:inherits; border-width:1px; border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem ;\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jhelvy/iris-rev2/\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title my-auto px-3 pt-3 pb-1\">Iris Rev 2</h5>\n</a>\n<p class=\"card-text my-auto px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">Build log and gallery of how I built my Iris Rev 2 keyboard.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
